-- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Blacksmithing shields - GENERATED by shields.py. Do not edit by hand.
--
--   18 shields, three per tier: all-metal (str/sta), leather+metal (int/spi),
--   and wood+metal (sta/agi). Blacksmithing previously made FOUR shields in total,
--   two of them item level 70, so nothing was craftable between level 18 and 60.
--
--   Armour and block are inherited by cloning a real shield of each item level, so
--   they sit on the existing curve rather than being invented.
--
-- Run against tw_world. IDEMPOTENT. Needs a mangosd RESTART and a rebuilt patch-6.mpq.
-- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

